  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Elite Skill. For 5...29...35 seconds, you gain 3 Energy each time you hit with a melee attack. Warrior's Endurance cannot raise your Energy above 10...22...25.",
      "zhTW": "持續 5～35 秒，每一次你利用近身攻擊命中目標時獲得 3 能量。但是當你的能量超過 10～25 時，戰士忍耐態勢將無法再讓你獲得能量。"
    },
    "pvp": {
